{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Make use of the puppet\u2019s strings in unique puzzles, find your way around obstacles, cross raging rivers, sneak through bandit camps and make it past dangerous traps to find freedom. <br></li><li>Explore a beautiful and grim world, inspired by the tone and mood of traditional fairy tales.<br></li><li>Live through an intense story of hope and empowerment.<br></li><li>Find out what it takes to truly break free from all strings attached.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><i>&quot;Ladies and Gentlemen! Come in, come in! In the mood for a story, are we?&quot;</i> <br><br>Abby is an artiste held captive at a circus: She spends her days entertaining the audience and her nights in a cage, longing for freedom. One day, she escapes the circus and gets to explore a mystical world. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1252830/extras/f4cff23fbd94e0c5282ba2bc157ff96a.poster.avif?t=1748561340\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1252830/extras/f4cff23fbd94e0c5282ba2bc157ff96a.webm?t=1748561340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1252830/extras/f4cff23fbd94e0c5282ba2bc157ff96a.mp4?t=1748561340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Alas, freedom comes at a cost and Abby soon finds herself dragged into the dangers this world has to offer: In a war-torn, medieval fairytale, surrounded by ravaged, starving citizens and hunted by the relentless cut-throat Tonda, Abby has to cross raging rivers, make it through bandit camps and around traps. <br><br>Her adventure is always accompanied by the lyrical rhymes of puppet master Jack, who is telling her story while holding the strings of his puppets firmly in his ever-helpful hands.<br> <br>Who can Abby trust? Can she find a way to truly break free? Despite dangling from her threads, will Abby learn that she can still influence her destiny?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1252830/extras/cb3eb1412729a965ebe638b33282dac2.poster.avif?t=1748561340\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1252830/extras/cb3eb1412729a965ebe638b33282dac2.webm?t=1748561340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1252830/extras/cb3eb1412729a965ebe638b33282dac2.mp4?t=1748561340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>&quot;Abby, Abby... Don't you see, the threads holding you up \u2013 also hold you back.&quot;</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bullseye","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252830/c85e222e936ee93a548b92525f62d126a7ae5456.jpg"},{"name":"An apple a day...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252830/03f0f5015615b63fa6ae6ececa2854ce0a3bd1f1.jpg"},{"name":"On to adventure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252830/197219789609fcc66e40eba761d052dd219d9a25.jpg"},{"name":"Lunchtime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252830/74467458cc813fc173579ea9982f2d7fb4290c91.jpg"},{"name":"Animal Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252830/5eac1430fc0a8fa2334c7a3bbd05f20e12d08461.jpg"},{"name":"Scaredy-cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252830/aae0fd76c101ed16c52793cf3ca4e18aeaa6ebc5.jpg"},{"name":"On Dry Feet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1252830/cb3cb71ca0bb1d881eec73e9f9ba